<title>USA: Pampa ISD, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik.</title>
<headline>Pampa ISD, Texas, won by Griffin Kubik.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik Stephens &amp; Thompson said it won $8.100 million of Pampa Independent School District, Texas, school building unlimited tax bonds, series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.28 percent.</p>
</text>
